{"kind":"agent-run","version":8,"status":"active","label":"Agent run","description":"One agent's execution of one protocol step, as a packet: claimed at dispatch, briefed with the exact prompt, building until the run's gate goes green or a run that ships no car delivers its work (landed), the agent stops without doing it (refused), or the packet goes silent past twice the step's duration (died). The middle third of the operator surface — a builder that dies is a packet that ages.","category":"platform","subject_kinds":["custom"],"steps":[{"title":"claimed","kind":"trigger","ready_when":"true","title_template":"Step claimed by the agent","sign_offs_required":[],"fields":[],"authority_role":null,"metadata_defaults":{"trigger_kind":"operator","trigger_name":"boss-dispatch"}},{"title":"briefed","kind":"task","ready_when":"steps.claimed.done","title_template":"Prompt printed","sign_offs_required":[],"fields":[{"name":"prompt_bytes","field_type":"string","required":true,"filled_by":"executor"}],"authority_role":"platform-admin","metadata_defaults":null},{"title":"building","kind":"task","ready_when":"steps.briefed.done","title_template":"Building","sign_offs_required":[],"duration_hours":2.0,"fields":[{"name":"result","field_type":"gated|delivered|refused|died","required":true,"filled_by":"executor"}],"authority_role":"platform-admin","metadata_defaults":{"records_before_claim":["launch.model"],"worker_start_expectation":{"minutes":15,"schema":1}}},{"title":"reported","kind":"task","ready_when":"steps.building.done AND (steps.building.metadata.result = \"gated\" OR steps.building.metadata.result = \"delivered\")","title_template":"Report recorded","sign_offs_required":[],"duration_hours":1.0,"fields":[{"name":"summary","field_type":"string","required":true,"filled_by":"executor"},{"name":"handback","field_type":"recorded|absent","required":false,"filled_by":"executor"},{"name":"spend_usd","field_type":"string","required":false,"filled_by":"executor"},{"name":"tokens","fie